## Scenarios

### generic syntax repros

#### dispatches methods through a generic type alias

- Verify: dispatches methods through a generic type alias
   - Expected: values.length() equals `1`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: dispatches methods through a generic type alias")
val values = ReproIntVec(items: [])
values.push(10)
expect(values.length()).to_equal(1)
```

</details>

#### parses generic instance method calls

- Verify: parses generic instance method calls
   - Expected: box.get() equals `42`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

